        "title": "Double the Power. Twice the Possibility.",
        "text": "The Sensol RS03 represents a generational leap in home strength training. With 120 kg of total resistance adjustable in 0.5 kg increments, two independent motors deliver 3,000 watts of digital force - precise enough for clinical rehabilitation, powerful enough for elite athletic training. 200+ guided movements across three training modes put a complete strength studio in the footprint of a coffee table."
