        "eyebrow": "01 — Digital Weight",
        "title": "0.5 kg precision. No springs. No guesswork.",
        "text_1": "Every spring-loaded reformer before the RS03 forced a compromise: a click, a swap, a missing plate. RS03 replaces all of that with two digitally controlled motors. Cable tension is measured 1,000 times per second and adjusted in real time, so 0.5 kg is exactly 0.5 kg - at the top of the pull, at the bottom, and through every millimetre of the stroke.",
        "text_2": "Two motors, two cables, two independent forces. The left arm can pull at 14 kg while the right pushes at 22.5 - simultaneously, from one machine, without a single weight swap."
      }
    },
