        "text_1": "Studio reformers do one thing well. Strength machines do another. The RS03 is engineered to do both - with a moving carriage for classical reformer repertoire, and two independent cable arms for chest press, row, lat pulldown, tricep extension, bicep curl, and every other cable movement you'd expect from a full commercial cable column.",
