            "question": "What's the warranty coverage?",
            "answer": "Lifetime warranty on the steel frame and all structural components. 5-year warranty on the dual motors, digital control board, and electronic components. 2-year warranty on the carriage, pulleys, cables, and fabric/upholstery. The companion app and digital class library are included for the life of the machine with no subscription required."
