          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the RS03 suitable for beginners?",
            "answer": "Absolutely. The 0.5 kg increment precision means you can start as light as 0.5 kg per arm and build up gradually. The app's Beginner Pathway walks you through 4 weeks of foundational movements before any strength work. Most users with no prior Pilates or strength training experience are comfortably training independently within their first week."
          }
        },
