          "settings": {
            "question": "How loud is it? Will it disturb my neighbours?",
            "answer": "45 dB at full load - quieter than a normal conversation. The RS03 uses belt-driven motors rather than weight stacks or chains, so there's no clanking, no slamming, no impact noise. Apartment-friendly even in strata buildings with strict noise rules."
          }
        },
